      "requirement_name": "Safety decision",
      "deadline": "If face-to-face safety contacts are completed within 4 working days: safety assessment recorded in Ohio's CCWIS within 10 working days and approved within 2 working days of submission (OAC 5180:3-5-01(D)(2)). If they are not completed within 4 working days: attempts continue and the safety assessment is recorded and approved within 3 working days after the face-to-face contacts are completed (OAC 5180:3-5-01(D)(3))",
